Changelog

 First optimization stage: reduced RAM usage for loading shaders;
 Fixed ammo that disappeared when Mia reloaded her pistol;
 Fixed evidence that still didn't appear in some cases after defeating the [spoiler]Graveyard boss[/spoiler];
 Adjustments to the background of the Mental Map to make it more legible;
 Fixed the “Try again.” text in cases where it kept appearing on the screen after respawning;
 Minor adjustments on evidence descriptions on the Mental Map;
 Adjustments to English recorder subtitles' timing;
 Fixed a repeated line in Spanish in the [spoiler]Other Ending[/spoiler];
 Fixed collisions that could cause the player to get stuck on [spoiler]Graveyard Hill[/spoiler].

We are aware of some performance issues causing the game to take a long time to open or experience low FPS in certain areas and we're continuing to work on those issues.

If you have more feedbacks, visit our Discord.

