Changelog

 Bug fix that prevented [spoiler]?????[/spoiler] when completing the Cursed Puzzles with Samuel 
 Fix for the bug that caused the Spiral Castle Boss arena to not load properly when returning to it after defeating the boss; 
 Fix for bugs that could cause problems with the Keypads; 
 Resets Mia's health and sanity when entering the [spoiler]Other Ending[/spoiler]; 
 Added more ammo and medkits in the [spoiler]Other Ending[/spoiler]; 
 Fix for the pause menu in the Cathedral's external scene; 
 Balancing the fight that takes place at the Cathedral 
 Removing the green card from the Crystal Cave; 
 Fix for saving after defeating the Cemetery boss; 
 Adds confirmation text when trying to exit the game;
 Changes the position of a specific tombstone that was too hidden in the Crack area 
 Player can no longer fall and get stuck in a small part in the Crack area;
 Adjustment of an evidence with the wrong name in the Castle's Mind Map;
 Adjustment to the Cursed Riddles of the [spoiler] Pen Drive, Butter on Butter and Imported Miniature [/spoiler];
 Removes the Radio indicator appearing during an important cutscene.


We are aware of some performance issues causing the game to take a long time to open or experience low FPS in certain areas. We are planning to release a compatibility and optimization patch soon. 

If you have more feedbacks, visit our Discord.
